  unitName: Sacred Judge Isniel
  unitId: 21007
  unitNumber: 1652
  description: Had the Holy Emperor chosen to transform Isniel into a disciple instead
    of a Sealed God, the Sacred Judge likely would have also gained a form fit for
    such a position. Isniel likely would have repaid the debt by serving as a loyal
    retainer with powers equal to a member of the Divine Ten. Even when the Holy
    Emperor was later cast down to Ishgria, Isniel almost certainly would have rushed
    to aid in the battle against the demonic assailants. Indeed, with Isniel's aid,
    the Holy Emperor might have driven off the demons and fully pacified Ishgria.
  summonDesc: Wherever...you are...<br>I will always...aid you...<br>That...is my
    debt...
  fusionDesc: My power...is yours...<br>I am...glad...<br>To fight...for you...
  evoDesc: This is...my new form...<br>So you...accept me?<br>Then I...will prove
    myself...worthy...
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
